      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "task-class",
          "nodeId": "task"
        },
        "markdown": "Task is the smallest unit intended for one focused implementation cycle.\n\nAuthored fields: `label`, `title`, `body`, `status`, `priority`, `owner`, `estimateHours`, `targetDate`, `startedAt`, `completedAt`, `externalRef`, `acceptanceCriteria`.\n\nThe detail surface represents the full editor contract; card and icon surfaces are deliberate projections.",
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "Task is the smallest unit intended for one focused implementation cycle.\n\nAuthored fields: `label`, `title`, `body`, `status`, `priority`, `owner`, `estimateHours`, `targetDate`, `startedAt`, `completedAt`, `externalRef`, `acceptanceCriteria`.\n\nThe detail surface represents the full editor contract; card and icon surfaces are deliberate projections."
        },
        "renderShape": {
          "kind": "markdown"
        }
      }
    },
